### yearly.family [rating=good.driver=steady] en#2
The household's sky stays flat and mild this year, which makes consistency the single advanced skill on offer. January's plans complete on schedule; elders convert reliable presence into trust. Choose improvements with long half-lives — systems, savings, care arrangements — over short-lived pushes. Keep contact pace steady: modest weekly touches beat quarterly marathons. Maintain a buffer for gatherings and travel, and review recurring expenses once. Expansion is available in small, planned steps. Beware the boredom trap — even years invite restlessness, and restlessness spends patience's earnings. Hold the line gently; the year pays more than its quiet promises suggest, and December proves it.

### yearly.family [rating=moderate.driver=steady] en#2
No deciding transit pulls the household this year — flat, moderate ground where habits alone set outcomes. The year suits consolidation: tighter routines, cleaner records, better margins of time. Growth moves in inches — one ritual, one repair, one system. Avoid big bets; the sky neither funds nor punishes them, so risk buys nothing here. Keep promises few and delivery on time. A monthly family review shows drift early. Where mid-year energy dips, schedule light weeks deliberately instead of surrendering them to fatigue. Steady, patient operation leaves the year stable, instructive, and further along than it feels.

